<Project>
  <!-- Shields everything under tools/ from the repo-root Directory.Build.props
       SbprValidateSdkPaths target, which hard-errors unless the Valheim managed-
       assembly path is configured. MSBuild walks up and stops at the FIRST
       Directory.Build.props it finds, so this override intercepts before the root.

       The tool projects here (niflheim-homestead-selector, cartography-ui-preview,
       niflheim-progression-spike) are headless net8.0 utilities that reference no
       game/BepInEx assemblies and must build on any box / in CI without the Valheim
       SDK fetched. The shipping mod at src/SBPR.Niflheim.HomesteadStones/ lives in a
       sibling subtree and still finds the root props unchanged. -->
</Project>
